### ============================================
### USERS - Admin Endpoints
### ============================================
### Deze file bevat admin-only endpoints voor gebruikersbeheer.
### Zorg dat je eerst ingelogd bent als ADMIN (auth.rest) om een token te hebben.
### ============================================

### VARIABELEN
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@contentType = application/json

### ADMIN TOKEN - Vul dit in na admin login (kopieer uit auth.rest response)
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HIER 

### ============================================
### GET ENDPOINTS (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 1. GET ALL USERS - Haal alle gebruikers op (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### PATCH ENDPOINTS (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 2. MAKE ADMIN - Maak gebruiker admin (Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/1/make-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### TEST SCENARIOS
### ============================================

### Scenario: Admin user management
### 1. Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. Make user admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/2/make-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. Verify (get all users again)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

